# Branching

Workflow: agent-safe.

## Branches

- Create `{{config.git.branchPrefix}}<ticket>` from `main`. Example: `{{config.git.branchPrefix}}128-login`.
- Use a separate git worktree per branch so two agents never share a working tree.
- Do not commit or push on `main`.

## Pull requests

- Cap the diff at {{config.git.maxPrLines}} lines, excluding lockfiles.
- A human reviews and merges. Agents do not merge their own pull requests.
- One concern per pull request.

## Commits

Use Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, `chore:`.
